{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/5e7f3b40fa1b4cfbf5f896056f5fec6f.poster.avif?t=1764435121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/5e7f3b40fa1b4cfbf5f896056f5fec6f.webm?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/5e7f3b40fa1b4cfbf5f896056f5fec6f.mp4?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/1114ed0cdff664b9cd8d17fa736f0a1b.avif?t=1764435121\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oops.. Where's My Bikini?! \ud83d\udc59\ud83d\udd25</strong> is a stylish adult visual novel set in a tropical paradise full of secrets, ambition, and unexpected seduction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sultry romance, mature situations, and spicy encounters are part of the journey \u2014 explore at your own pace and taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young guy whose dreams collapsed just when the finish line seemed close. With no easy road back, you grab a chance to work at an exclusive island resort \u2014 a place where luxury, power, and desire mingle under palm shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/ad7b707964bf82d8b3a2cb776498d183.poster.avif?t=1764435121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/ad7b707964bf82d8b3a2cb776498d183.webm?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/ad7b707964bf82d8b3a2cb776498d183.mp4?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/ec74a1a0aaf374940c0d72b29f8bd0a3.avif?t=1764435121\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/094ab1d4866dd3194888b7c0d19ee331.poster.avif?t=1764435121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/094ab1d4866dd3194888b7c0d19ee331.webm?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/094ab1d4866dd3194888b7c0d19ee331.mp4?t=1764435121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life here looks perfect: ocean sunsets, VIP guests, parties that never end, and opportunities that open with the right smile\u2026 or touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon the glossy surface begins to crack. Behind the cocktails and confidence hides a world of pressure, temptation, and secrets too big to ignore. And beyond the resort gates \u2014 an island that breathes mystery and trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm, ambition, and instinct are your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way back to the life you want \u2014 or build a new one in paradise, one irresistible encounter at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658660/extras/7a42f